OL,3,GNEWSACouncil withdraws football racism
OL,4,Acharity backing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA black former footballer, who suffered
OL,7,Fracial abuse during his career, said a
OL,8,Fcouncil's decision to withdraw support
OL,9,Ffor the game's anti-racism charity was
OL,10,Fa "massive step back".
OL,12,FGary Bennett, who played for Sunderland
OL,13,Ffrom 1984 to 1995, said he was "in
OL,14,Fshock" after learning the city's
OL,15,FReform-led council was ending a 30-year
OL,16,Fpartnership with Show Racism the Red
OL,17,FCard.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
