OL,3,GNEWSACouncil withdraws football racism
OL,4,Acharity backing
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Chris Eynon said the
OL,7,Fauthority would not support
OL,8,F"politically charged organisations with
OL,9,Fan agenda" and accused charity chief
OL,10,Fexecutive Ged Grebby of "stark
OL,11,Fpolitical bias" in comments about
OL,12,FReform.
OL,14,FGrebby defended his right to express
OL,15,Fpersonal views and said the charity had
OL,16,Fsupport across the political spectrum.
